  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, red pepper flakes, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add the beef, onion, and bell pepper to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "4. Thread the beef and vegetables onto skewers.",
    "5. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until the beef reaches 135°F for medium-rare.",
    "6. Brush with chimichurri sauce during the last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving."
